{
  "id": "isc-international-stable-currency",
  "genius": {
    "applicability": "non-payment-token",
    "applicabilityBasis": {
      "summary": "ISC is designed for transactions but expressly has no fiat-currency peg: its target price references an appreciating basket of commodities, bonds and equity. The opened documents do not promise redemption for a fixed amount of national currency or a bank deposit. It therefore falls outside the tracked GENIUS payment-stablecoin definition; this assessment does not resolve securities law.",
