    "foreignExceptionStatus": "not-applicable",
    "daspOfferSaleStatus": "not-applicable",
    "notes": "The ISC Issuer function is described as operated by ISC Foundation, but an exact incorporated legal issuer name and domicile were not established, so issuerEntity is omitted. Non-payment-token is a statutory scope label: the product can be used for transactions without satisfying fixed monetary-value stability/redemption. The reserve basket is not shown to be a fund share owned by holders, so excluded-security is not asserted. Proposed quarterly audits do not establish monthly independent attestations. Other securities, investment-product and distribution rules can remain applicable.",
